<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Universal Appliances suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Universal Appliances suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of electronic products maker and distributor Universal Appliances Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The company shares ended HK$0.001 up at HK$0.201 on Thursday with 515,500 shares traded.</p>
<p>Brokers said they speculated the suspension might relate to some kind cash call exercise.</p>
<p>The company's officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
